     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">Pozdravljeni,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">včeraj je prišla na plano novica, da je Microsoft (ki je pred časom kupil Revolution analytics) izdal<a href=\"https://blogs.technet.microsoft.com/machinelearning/2016/03/09/announcing-r-tools-for-visual-studio-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://blogs.technet.microsoft.com/machinelearning/2016/03/09/announcing-r-tools-for-visual-studio-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11v5eK4ev9nsoVjQQwjYdX\"> odprtokodno razvijalsko okolje</a> RTVS (R tools for Visual Studio) imenovano. Okolje poleg R-ja omogoča tudi razvoj kode v Python, C++, C#, Node.JS in drugih jezikih.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">Spodaj je seznam ta velikih lastnosti, obljubljajo pa tudi, da bodo vgradili želje uporabnikov. Od trenutno verjetno najbolj popularnega RStudija se razlikuje predvsem v tem, da podpira še druge jezike in omogoča razhroščevanje s prelomnimi točkami, korakanjem po kodi, nadzorna okna za spremeljivke... Paket se razvija na <a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/RTVS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Microsoft/RTVS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LHcSwl12o7FDSER2bQ5cN\">GitHubu</a>.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><ul style=\"font-family:WOL_Reg,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:0px 0px 1.5em 3em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);line-height:21px\"><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/editing.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/editing.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Cf-tZ4900pRVf4mkSHxNF\">Editor</a> – complete editing experience for R scripts and functions, including detachable/tabbed windows, syntax highlighting, and much more.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/intellisense.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/intellisense.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AHty5i2BQiuCgOyzgu3FM\">IntelliSense</a> – (aka auto-completion) available in both the editor and the Interactive R window.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/interactive-repl.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/interactive-repl.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SpSMYf1UG9235Mm7fZUw3\">R Interactive Window</a> – work with the R console directly from within Visual Studio.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/history.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/history.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1c5OIX1OkTdG6X4tvkT1gi\">History window</a> – view, search, select previous commands and send to the Interactive window.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/variable-explorer.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/variable-explorer.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1R9I_Ja_s9rL76X6nQ0-FG\">Variable Explorer</a> – drill into your R data structures and examine their values.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/plotting.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/plotting.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17WZH36ms71iEeiix7brsk\">Plotting</a> – see all of your R plots in a Visual Studio tool window.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/debugging.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/debugging.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0qgqyO284t65SM234OvdCH\">Debugging</a> – breakpoints, stepping, watch windows, call stacks and more.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/rmarkdown.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/rmarkdown.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rZWbU3P-YgN4g5nkK35RL\">R Markdown</a> – R Markdown/knitr support with export to Word and HTML.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/git.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/git.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3FDrnp1EZEN8zL7G2-WUg2\">Git</a> – source code control via Git and GitHub.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/extensions.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/extensions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2I6tHNM-VLAyIwh988NmaM\">Extensions</a> – over 6,000 Extensions covering a wide spectrum from Data to Languages to Productivity.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/help.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/help.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FyXVBw_SjgXQ-5ome2oQy\">Help</a> – use ? and ?? to view R documentation within Visual Studio.</li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px\"><a href=\"http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/polyglot.html\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;border:0px;outline:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(150,150,150)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://microsoft.github.io/RTVS-docs/polyglot.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237138193000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2z8mGrIGM_JAwLXFUdfJYi\">A polyglot IDE</a> – VS supports R, Python, C++, C#, Node.js, SQL, etc. projects simultaneously.</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">​Veselo testiranje.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">lp,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">Roman​</div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\">In God we trust, all others bring data.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
